# Interactive class (user unit, ADR-0042 section 11, ADR-0103): the units on the path of an owner
# turn, ulei-engine, ulei-inbox, ulei-tg, ulei-memory, ulei-hive-mcp and ulei-garden, and the
# owner's alerts, ulei-uncertain and ulei-hive-watchdog. It sets no IO, CPU or memory limit: each
# unit keeps its own MemoryMax and TasksMax, and the IOPS caps of the other classes leave the rest
# of the disk to it.
[Unit]
Description=ulei units on the path of an owner turn
